From 795557bd879757276281b7749120c77f771dcbd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:06:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(about): continuous push handoff, shorter scroll,
 chaptered 3D About

Transition
- hero dive 400svh -> 340svh (-540px at 900px tall); floors in two tests follow
- bench phases tightened (hold 0.12 -> 0.10); entry stays inside the pinned budgets
- the sheet's layers now arrive at 0.88 and keep growing into place during the
  takeover, continuing the hero's dive direction instead of swapping surfaces

Title to end of About
- ticker: two rows of outlined type slide past each other as the title leaves
- three chapters, each with a pinned real-3D device driven only by --p:
  sampler (pads light in sequence), cassette (reels turn), record + level meter
- headings and the closing offer reveal word by word (generic useBenchReveal)
- finale: place, availability line and a pill resume link
- left-edge playhead rail tracks the whole About
- devices windows retimed to the tighter arc
---
